        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana HPH89, Door Stop for Brass Door Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nHinge Mounted Door Stop for Brass Hinge stops the door on the hinge not the jam. Hinge mounted door stop for use with Solid <a href=\"/collections/solid-brass-hinges\"><b>Brass Door Hinges</b></a>. Made of solid brass and available in great finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<font color=red><b>Note:</b> This stop is specifically made to work with a <b>SOLID BRASS HINGE</b> - Not a Steel hinge finished in brass (Brass Colored).</font> For steel door hinges please use <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-hinge-mount-door-stop-deltana-hps88\">Deltana HPS88 Hinge Pin Door Stop</a> \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe door opening adjustment range is approximately from 90 degrees to 140 degrees. Note that the thickness of the jamb moulding and the distance of the hinge pin from the door face will affect the adjustment range for each application. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nExtended Length Button Tips <b>must be used to install</b> this hinge pin door stop on Solid Brass Hinges. They can be selected below if you do not all ready have them.  One is required with each door stop. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-HPH89-Specifications.gif?v=1704354578\" width=\"600\" height=\"234\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Stop for Brass Door Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana HPH89 Hinge Pin Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin Diameter: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin Diameter with Reducer Bushing: 5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Opening Range: 90 - 140 Degrees, Approximate</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Bumpers: 9/16\" Diameter, Gray Rubber</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/HPH89.pdf?v=1704262156\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana HPH89 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>For use with Solid Brass Door Hinges</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Hinge Pin Door Stop for Brass Door Hinge",
                "description": "Door Stop for Brass Door Hinge, Deltana HPH89 - Hinge Mounted Door Stop for Brass Hinge stops the door on the hinge not the jam. This hinge stop requires a number HPSS70 extension button tip. Available in nine finishes.",
